      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "SNEAKO gets into a HEATED debate with his tour guide in the Philippines after he says he doesn\u2019t wear traditional attire like the \"Barong Tagalog\" because he\u2019s Muslim and only follows Arabic culture \ud83d\ude33\ud83d\udc40\n\n\u201cI understand you\u2019re Muslim, but you can still wear it. There\u2019s nothing haram about it. You\u2019re not Arabic bro... you don\u2019t have to be Arab to be Muslim.\u201d\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/dailysneako/status/2049891043575812305",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:38:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Just ran into this Filipino group at the hotel",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/AltSNEAKO/status/2049850661987024997",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T13:57:36+00:00",
