    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The most wholesome interaction on SNEAKO\u2019s stream when he met this group of Philippines kids that wanted to meet him\u2026\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded\n\nVideo",
